    "created_at": "2016-05-31T18:36:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-31T18:36:22Z",
    "body": "Blink removed support for general multipart/x-mixed-replace navigations in https://src.chromium.org/viewvc/blink?view=revision&revision=152363 and added back in narrow support for images-as-main-resource in https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/3b48d99c334c370b39f041ef3a6f743faa61b426.  I think restrict to images is a good tradeoff, as MJPEG seems to be the case users have cared about.\n",
